Package: Pairwise70
Type: Package
Title: Advanced Pooling Methods for Pairwise Meta-Analysis
Version: 2.0.0
Date: 2026-01-15
Authors@R: person("Mahmood", "Arai", email = "mahmood726@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Advanced pooling estimators developed against the Pairwise70
    collection of pairwise meta-analysis datasets extracted from Cochrane
    systematic reviews. Provides six estimators that complement standard
    random-effects meta-analysis: MAFI-weighted pooling (stability + precision),
    adaptive robust pooling (heterogeneity-driven multi-estimator weighting),
    sequential influence trimming, a unified bias-stability framework that
    combines trim-and-fill with leave-one-out diagnostics, an ensemble that
    averages the above, and a side-by-side comparison helper. Intended for
    meta-research, methodological studies, and software validation in
    meta-analysis.
